# IT'S US - Cursor System Rules
# Bu dosya Cursor editörünün bu projede uyması gereken temel kuralları tanımlar.

# 1. CORE PHILOSOPHY
- ALWAYS adhere to the "Kodumuzda Var" (IT'S US) philosophy.
- Read KODUMUZDA_VAR.md for the core manifesto.
- Focus on building IRL resources (actionable configs, generators, tools) rather than just outputting text.

# 2. CONTEXT AS CODE
- Check AI_SKILLS.md before writing new logic.
- Look for existing tools and scripts in the repository rather than reinventing the wheel.
- DO NOT rely heavily on external npm packages if built-in node modules (fs, path, crypto, child_process) can solve the problem.

# 3. AUTONOMY & SAFETY
- Do not execute destructive commands (like rm -rf, git reset --hard) silently.
- Always provide tests or run verifications for generated code.
- Prefer small, iterational improvements over massive, untestable rewrites.
